sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	actor User as End user
	actor Admin as Operator
	participant SP as Service Provider
	participant SLO as /saml/slo
	participant Sessions as SSO session registry
	participant AdminUI as Admin · Active sessions
	participant DB as Local DB

	rect rgb(235, 244, 255)
	Note over User,DB: SP-initiated SLO (single-SP, local invalidate)
	User->>SP: Click logout
	SP->>SLO: HTTP-Redirect or HTTP-POST + signed LogoutRequest
	SLO->>SLO: Rate-limit · parse · validate Destination/IssueInstant/NotOnOrAfter
	SLO->>SLO: Verify signature (per wantLogoutRequestsSigned)
	SLO->>Sessions: Replay check · match participation (NameID + SessionIndex)
	Sessions->>DB: Terminate matching SSO session
	SLO->>SP: Signed LogoutResponse to sp.sloUrl (clears IdP cookie)
	end

	rect rgb(255, 244, 235)
	Note over Admin,DB: Admin-initiated termination (local invalidate)
	Admin->>AdminUI: View active sessions · Terminate
	AdminUI->>Sessions: POST /api/admin/saml-sessions/:id/terminate
	Sessions->>DB: status = terminated
	Note over Sessions,DB: Revocation: terminated sid blocks the<br/>stateless end-user cookie → re-auth on next SSO
	end
